  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A piece of wire with a length of <math alttext=\"32\"><mn>32</mn>\n</math> inches is cut into two parts. One part has a length of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> inches, and the other part has a length of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> inches. The value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math> more than <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> times the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
